 ear seeds are easy to use and come with clear instructions. They’re designed to support your wellbeing naturally, whether you’re new to TCM or experienced.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="31389f2f-06bc-4a55-af87-6cb9777fadf3" class="r-1eh2pk2" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f7ba8883-842a-494a-b704-2d945e000add" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rhbb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-jkzmx"><div data-rid="f1ec04dc-cf97-4955-a6a2-d2da4e4e50cd" class="r-1bkd0d1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use ear seeds alongside medication or other treatments?</p></span></div><div data-rid="76a19c4d-0eff-4fd2-b082-ba52e2c8691e" class="r-1rwihxq" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1rad63x" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rhbb2:"><div data-rid="3ed0f1e9-18dc-4d8e-a8b0-6f2b0a78718f" class="r-ytbodv"><div data-rid="624c6704-2c3c-48cd-8eb4-e2358aa1e99e" class="r-117r1zx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Ear seeds are a natural complement to your existing wellness routine. However, if you have specific health concerns, we recommend consulting your healthcare provider.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9b299a4c-30e6-460e-84e1-bdafd707e9b1" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="review-sec" tabindex="-1" id="review-sec" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-6clyph"><div data-rid="cf7e7423-d9ac-454c-9ea7-c2ad42c5a733" class="r-1dbjejg"><div data-rid="1ea788e3-7a5a-4cd8-a342-ddd5b5ba6a2b" class="r-8a9vad alchemy-rte"><span